# A teammate's story port brings this player along even when that cutscene's data is not loaded here (GateFollow),
# and a second report right after it is ignored, so a teammate cannot move this player at will.
# storyport sends what GateFollow reports when a story cutscene carried its player far.

include session.coop

A tp 44432,20552
B expect teammate >= 3000 timeout=20
A storyport CutsceneData_NotLoadedOnTheClient
B expect counter followed >= 1 timeout=10
B expect teammate <= 500 timeout=10

# At once again: refused, the client stays where it is.
A tp -2132,-5262
B expect teammate >= 3000 timeout=20
A storyport CutsceneData_NotLoadedOnTheClient
sleep 4
B expect counter followed == 1 timeout=1
B expect teammate >= 3000 timeout=1
